---
import CorporateLayout from '../layouts/CorporateLayout.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
---

<CorporateLayout
  title="About"
  description="How Trinity Laboratories approaches applied research, testing, field work, and technical documentation."
  active="about"
>
  <PageHero
    eyebrow="About Trinity Laboratories"
    title="Careful research, built for practical use."
    intro="We bring laboratory work, technical testing, field observation, and documentation together in a clear, repeatable process."
    index="TL / ABOUT"
  />

  <section class="section" data-reveal>
    <div class="editorial-grid">
      <p class="prose-large">
        Our role is to frame the question clearly, choose the right method, and make the results
        easy to understand.
      </p>
      <div>
        <p class="section-label">Our approach</p>
        <p>
          Projects can bring together laboratory controls, instrument design, field observation,
          safety, and documentation. Each discipline follows its own standards, while shared records
          keep the work connected and traceable.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--dark" data-reveal>
    <div class="section__heading">
      <p class="section-label">How we work</p>
      <h2>A clear question. A method that can be reviewed.</h2>
      <p>We document what we set out to do, what we observed, and what still needs an answer.</p>
    </div>
    <ol class="ruled-list">
      <li>
        <small>01</small><strong>Start with the question and define its boundaries.</strong><span
          >Scope</span
        >
      </li>
      <li>
        <small>02</small><strong>Use appropriate instruments and document the method.</strong><span
          >Control</span
        >
      </li>
      <li>
        <small>03</small><strong>Record observations before interpreting them.</strong><span
          >Evidence</span
        >
      </li>
      <li>
        <small>04</small><strong>Keep decisions, exceptions, and revisions traceable.</strong><span
          >Record</span
        >
      </li>
    </ol>
  </section>

  <section class="section" data-reveal>
    <div class="section__heading">
      <p class="section-label">Documentation</p>
      <h2>Good documentation keeps useful work accessible.</h2>
      <p>
        We preserve original records and their revisions so methods, decisions, and results can be
        understood over time.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="button-row">
      <a class="button button--primary" href="/publications/">Browse publications</a>
      <a class="button" href="/employee-access/">Staff sign in</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</CorporateLayout>
